--- !u!114 &1041007802
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1041007799}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ff7a654d932174f45b141d2b0de5b863, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  linkedSubtitleTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  onCloseObjective: {fileID: 0}
  onCloseAudio: {fileID: 0}
  noteTitle: Old note.
  noteContent: "If you are reading this\u2026 then I have failed.\r\nDo not trust
    the silence.\r\nDo not trust your senses.\r\nIt will try to guide you.\r\nIt
    will try to make you finish what we could not\u2026\r\nBut the ritual does not
    seal it anymore.\r\nIt lets it in.\r\n\r\nThere is another way.\r\nOld magic.
    Older than the church.\r\nFather Mateo told me once\u2026\r\n\"The tree that
    weeps near the second house.\r\nIt remembers what the church forgot.\r\nKneel
    before it. Pray.\r\nIt may still listen.\"\r\n\r\nI never believed him.\r\nBut
    now\u2026 it's our only hope.\r\n\r\nFind the weeping tree.\r\nPray.\r\nBefore
    Munduan finds you."
  readRange: 2
  readKey: 101
