  noteTitle: Old Note
  noteContent: "We were told to stop anyone from entering the village.\nBut the voices\u2026
    they don\u2019t come from outside.\nThey come from the church.\nFather Mateo
    says we must not listen.\nBut it\u2019s getting harder.\n\n\nWe kept a spare
    key to the first house. In case anyone got locked out. We put it inside the bedroom."
  readRange: 2
  readKey: 101
