  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ff7a654d932174f45b141d2b0de5b863, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  linkedSubtitleTrigger: {fileID: 675674281}
  onCloseObjective: {fileID: 0}
  onCloseAudio: {fileID: 339704663}
  noteTitle: Old note.
  noteContent: 'We tried to perform the ritual again.

    But something followed
    us out of the church.

    I saw it standing between the trees.

    Watching.

    Waiting.

    Munduan
    is no longer trapped.



    Father Mateo said the only way to stop it now

    is
    to complete the ritual inside the church.



    The items are ready.

    The
    candles. The Bible. The Cross.

    You just need to place them.



    I''m
    going back to the church.

    But I don''t think I''ll make it.



    If you''re
    reading this...

    take what you found here.

    Go to the church.

    Finish
    what we started.



    May God have mercy on us all.'
  readRange: 2
  readKey: 101
